<section class="page-head"><div class="container"><div class="eyebrow">ROADMAPS</div><h1>Parcours par domaine</h1><p>Un parcours type par grand domaine IT, avec une progression simple de certifications à viser.</p></div></section>
<section class="section"><div class="container tracks-intro"><div><h2>Choisis ton domaine</h2><p>Chaque roadmap présente une progression indicative. Les certifications restent à adapter au niveau et au projet de l’étudiant.</p></div><span class="chip neutral"><?= count($tracks) ?> domaines</span></div><div class="domain-track-grid"><?php foreach($tracks as $i=>$track): ?><article class="track-card"><div class="track-head"><div class="track-number">0<?= $i+1 ?></div><div class="track-title"><span class="eyebrow"><?= e(domain_label($track['domain'])) ?></span><h2><?= e($track['name']) ?></h2><p><?= e($track['description']) ?></p></div></div><div class="track-certs"><div class="track-certs-label">Progression type</div><?php foreach($track['certs'] as $j=>$cert): ?><a href="/certification?id=<?= (int)$cert['id'] ?>" class="track-cert"><span class="track-step"><?= str_pad((string)($j+1),2,'0',STR_PAD_LEFT) ?></span><div><b><?= e($cert['name']) ?></b><small><?= e($cert['vendor']) ?></small></div><span class="track-level <?= e(difficulty_class($cert['difficulty'] ?? 'intermediaire')) ?>"><i></i><?= e(difficulty_label($cert['difficulty'] ?? 'intermediaire')) ?></span></a><?php endforeach; ?></div></article><?php endforeach; ?></div></div></section>